        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 423,
        "paragraph_id": "0DFB17F5",
        "text": "The value for the skewness and asymmetry is calculated with the use of a Boltzmann sigmoid. The skewness and asymmetry are a function of Ψ. In the formulation of Ruessink et al. (2012) the p1:6 are used as parameterized factors on the data set of field observations."
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_kingsday.docx",
